%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WarehouseAdmin as Workshop Warehouse Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as CatalogService
    participant Records as ProductRepository
    participant Dep as AccessPolicy
    WarehouseAdmin->>UI: Create, update, or deactivate a part listing
    UI->>Service: Submit spare part catalog management request
    Service->>Records: Validate product details and workshop scope
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate SKU unik per bengkel dan harga tidak negatif
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: requireWorkshopScope(staff, workshop)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Save the catalog change
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Refresh the workshop catalog
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Return product validation errors
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
